{"title":"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Very_Risky,_only_attempt_if_you_have_very_little_time_left)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Very Risky, only attempt if you have very little time left)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/4/e0463dc4f67e71c9373c58d002cefffede5ca87d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(z)=\\dfrac{z+i}{z-i}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"102\" height=\"37\" /> for all complex numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/8/888de75846c906803bdc678fbf21426c81fc7f1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z\\neq i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"39\" height=\"17\" />, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/6/346191359f6b4840c6a5fe26372a516ff9817a2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z_n=F(z_{n-1})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"18\" /> for all positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/0/ff02f88f52d943b0f7f37e2ed2583d545e1c9215.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z_0=\\dfrac{1}{137}+i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"99\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/0/330ded65f9bb11dfd58f53aaea383e72db77b916.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z_{2002}=a+bi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"15\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are real numbers, find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Iterating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/1/d216445c7a4d2d2fe1c8a289187b43735d3ded86.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} F(z) &amp;= \\frac{z+i}{z-i}\\\\ F(F(z)) &amp;= \\frac{\\frac{z+i}{z-i}+i}{\\frac{z+i}{z-i}-i} = \\frac{(z+i)+i(z-i)}{(z+i)-i(z-i)}= \\frac{z+i+zi+1}{z+i-zi-1}= \\frac{(z+1)(i+1)}{(z-1)(1-i)}\\\\ &amp;= \\frac{(z+1)(i+1)^2}{(z-1)(1^2+1^2)}= \\frac{(z+1)(2i)}{(z-1)(2)}= \\frac{z+1}{z-1}i\\\\ F(F(F(z))) &amp;= \\frac{\\frac{z+1}{z-1}i+i}{\\frac{z+1}{z-1}i-i} = \\frac{\\frac{z+1}{z-1}+1}{\\frac{z+1}{z-1}-1} = \\frac{(z+1)+(z-1)}{(z+1)-(z-1)} = \\frac{2z}{2} = z. \\end{align*}\" width=\"604\" height=\"200\" />\n</p><p>From this, it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/e/a1e545e9a1036033c219201c8b1d4577e889a8e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z_{k+3} = z_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" />, for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />. Thus \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9863989e6e25ef259c5cdb967439a5c6cd3ef5f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z_{2002} = z_{3\\cdot 667+1} = z_1 = \\frac{z_0+i}{z_0-i} = \\frac{(\\frac{1}{137}+i)+i}{(\\frac{1}{137}+i)-i}= \\frac{\\frac{1}{137}+2i}{\\frac{1}{137}}= 1+274i.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"534\" height=\"47\" />\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/0/730f6f17e906728523a29f0c80db09eebc1cea13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b = 1+274 = \\boxed{275}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"185\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Very_Risky.2C_only_attempt_if_you_have_very_little_time_left.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Very_Risky,_only_attempt_if_you_have_very_little_time_left)\">Solution 2 (Very Risky, only attempt if you have very little time left)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Very Risky, only attempt if you have very little time left)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/d/58d18b3e671c1a42a107e5a2939a9f7763425129.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z_{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/b/d9b1c7bf484e3238c883b8976ab5f8243c9ca6a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{137}+2i}{\\frac{1}{137}}=1+274i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"156\" height=\"49\" />. Notice that when we solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/5/e25cc43726255abd9f93d1e7b1c761db97e99c79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" />, the result is equal to some non-integral real and imaginary part, where the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/5/e25cc43726255abd9f93d1e7b1c761db97e99c79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> is not equal to an integer. Because this is an AIME problem, the answer must be an integer, so there is most likely a pattern or cycle that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/b/c0baa2dc2cf1cd6832376885a2def3e5928e6de1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z_{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> goes through, and because out of the first 3 terms, only one of which has an integral value for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />, you can guess that the answer is likely <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/f/33fa76d9f93652091746ba5684d2118c8376d261.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+274=\\boxed{275}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"123\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~Voidling\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I\" title=\"2002 AIME I\">2002 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2002\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.pn